   ('The disagreement, told well', ['[STORY — confirm] The largest product lead: "not handing my pager to someone else\'s roadmap"', 'Changed: teams size their own shards; a written platform contract',
     'Held: routing, placement and egress stay in the platform'],
    "Here's the disagreement story from your retrospective — and this one is a constructed practice detail, so confirm it's true before you use it. The largest product lead didn't want to hand their pager to someone else's roadmap. You treated that as design input: teams kept control of their business logic and sized their own shards, and you wrote down a platform contract. What you held firm on was routing, placement and egress. That's the shape of a Staff answer: change the design, hold the invariant."),
